---
title: Operon Manual
description: How to use Operon. The first chapter covers the bookkeeping workbench.
---

This manual explains how to use Operon, step by step. It is written for the accountants, company secretaries and other professional staff who work in Operon every day.

## Chapters

- [Bookkeeping workbench](/en/bookkeeping/overview/): how a period's books are prepared, reconciled, reviewed and reported, from the first upload to the GST F5.

{% aside type="note" title="Examples in this manual" %}
All companies, people, amounts and account numbers in this manual are fictional. The example company is ABC PTE. LTD. (UEN 201900001A), a GST-registered trading company with a financial year ending on 31 December.
{% /aside %}

## Interface language

Operon can be used in English or Chinese. Each page of this manual is available in both languages; use the language menu at the top of the page to switch. Button and tab names are quoted exactly as they appear in the English interface.
